  einfaches Terminalprogramm                         clv 09dez00                                                                Kommentare                                                      M”glichkeit Forth-Fernbedienung / r/w                           CR/LF-Modus (jeweils y/n +/- fr key->dis .->lin lin->dis .->lin             +/- ::= append LF)                                 Multitasking-Kommandozeile  fr rtbytes,?key                    Benutzeroberfl„che: Zyklische Listen lesbarer                   šbertragung Files: bis 2000 baud, 1/3 der Zeit fr rtbytes      Help in MSG-Zeile?                                              clv2000dec09 : no #lf on cr-key                                 clv2000may13 : fixed a little bug around the stopbits                          in case of darkness try: $7001 atts !                           coulnd't find mono-monitor ($7F70 or $707F ?)                                                                                                                                    \ Terminal-Program                                   clv 09dez00\ bitte immer mit USE file  1 LOAD  laden !!                     Onlyforth        include uti.scr  \ loads following words:                       load: byeCLS callForth top?  link cycle                               saveemit Video LATER ibm-at?  instr                             "[ unget stay msgError .datim ;load     byeNoCLS          include protocol.scr                                            include term4ser.scr                                            include input.scr                              : .rev ." TERM4: Terminalprogramm clv2.3" "datim" count type ;                   2   4 thru \ Windows                                            5 &24 thru \ User-Shell                        ' bye Alias endterm    : bye  terminst full  r0 @ rp! ;         COM1 9.600 baud RTS 8+1 NONE    HALFDUPLEX   $707F atts !       terminal full savesystem term4.com  cr cr .( TERM4.COM saved )  endTerm        