                                                                                                \ onStatus onTerm onMsg                              clv 13jun89                                                                  : onStatus   r> withoutProt  area @ >r statLin                                  cursor @ >r cur!  at? at  >r                         LATER r> cursor !  r> area !  at? at ; restrict                                                                            : onTerm r>  area @ >r termArea  >r LATER r> area ! ; restrict                                                                  : onMsg  r>  area @ >r msg page  >r LATER r> area ! ; restrict                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                \ callit" doit .it it!                               clv 06jun89                                                                  : callit  ( .cfa do.-cfa -- )  link,  ,  ,  ;                   : lastcfa ( -- cfa )                                               last @ dup IF name> ELSE ['] noop THEN ;                     : callit"  lastcfa  here                                           ['] : @ ,  compile (."  ,"  compile unnest  swap callit ;    : doit ( adr -- ) @ 2+ perform ;                                : .it  ( adr -- ) @ 4+ perform ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              